# Normalize text files to LF in the repository, as usual.
* text=auto

# install.bat is the one file students download and run directly, and what they
# get is the stored blob - GitHub's "raw" view and the zip archive both serve it
# byte for byte, so core.autocrlf never gets a say. cmd.exe mis-parses
# parenthesised if/else blocks in a batch file with LF-only line endings, so the
# committed bytes have to be CRLF. Keep this file out of normalization.
*.bat -text
